{"text":"I looked for all sorts of jobs that were related, as a journalist, a TV anchor, an MC, nothing worked and nothing stuck. When people don't do what they want, they don't know what to do, said author Marty Rubin. There was no saving me from the agony of indecision until I stopped running away from myself and listened to myself. I took a time out, silenced the voices, stopped the chatter and really thought about what would make me happy. I admitted it, first to myself and then out loud, that what I wanted more than anything was to make believe for a living.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.66},{"text":"looked","start":0.66,"end":0.8},{"text":"for","start":0.8,"end":1.02},{"text":"all","start":1.02,"end":1.38},{"text":"sorts","start":1.38,"end":1.58},{"text":"of","start":1.58,"end":1.82},{"text":"jobs","start":1.82,"end":2.12},{"text":"that","start":2.12,"end":2.3},{"text":"were","start":2.3,"end":2.5},{"text":"related","start":2.5,"end":3.04,"punct":","},{"text":"as","start":3.54,"end":4.06},{"text":"a","start":4.06,"end":4.24},{"text":"journalist","start":4.24,"end":4.68,"punct":","},{"text":"a","start":5.26,"end":5.36},{"text":"TV","start":5.36,"end":5.66},{"text":"anchor","start":5.66,"end":6.14,"punct":","},{"text":"an","start":6.3,"end":6.42},{"text":"MC","start":6.42,"end":6.82,"punct":","},{"text":"nothing","start":7.1,"end":7.32},{"text":"worked","start":7.32,"end":7.82},{"text":"and","start":7.82,"end":8.56},{"text":"nothing","start":8.56,"end":8.86},{"text":"stuck","start":8.86,"end":9.26,"punct":"."},{"text":"When","start":10.76,"end":11.02},{"text":"people","start":11.02,"end":11.42},{"text":"don't","start":11.42,"end":11.78},{"text":"do","start":11.78,"end":12.12},{"text":"what","start":12.12,"end":12.36},{"text":"they","start":12.36,"end":12.56},{"text":"want","start":12.56,"end":13.04,"punct":","},{"text":"they","start":13.48,"end":13.62},{"text":"don't","start":13.62,"end":13.86},{"text":"know","start":13.86,"end":14.12},{"text":"what"